---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
const updated = "2026-11-26";
---
<PageLayout title="Now" description="What Four Paths is building, learning and exploring in November 2026.">
  <div class="wrap now-page">
    <header class="now-head"><div><h1>Right now.</h1><p class="lede">What’s moving at Four Paths.</p></div><p class="updated">Updated <time datetime={updated}>November 26, 2026</time></p></header>
    <div class="now-list">
      <section><div><h2>Building</h2><p>Improving <a href="/work/sadhana">Sadhana</a> now that it is on Google Play: a clearer beginner entry, stage-based progression, and spoken guidance that lets the screen recede. <a href="/work/chore-credits">Chore Credits</a> and <a href="/work/life-atlas">Life Atlas</a> are also in tester-facing states, each with a different question to resolve.</p></div></section>
      <section><div><h2>Client work</h2><p>Keeping <a href="/client-work/all-mountain-contracting">All Mountain Contracting</a> and <a href="/client-work/crabapple-cafe">The Crabapple Café</a> current: content tools, search continuity and tests that let the people running each business publish without a developer.</p><a class="text-link" href="/client-work">See the client work →</a></div></section>
      <section><div><h2>Exploring</h2><p>Software that requires less attention rather than more; how game mechanics can make an activity approachable without turning it into a compulsion; and how AI assistance can remain a proposal a person may decline.</p></div></section>
      <section><div><h2>Learning</h2><p>What real device use reveals about audio-first interfaces, and what household testing reveals about the difference between a well-formed rule and a fair-feeling agreement.</p></div></section>
      <section><div><h2>Recently changed</h2><p>Sadhana evolved from week-based progression to named, self-paced stages. That small language change reflects a larger product decision: practice should provide direction without creating a sense of being late.</p><a class="text-link" href="/notes/from-platform-to-practice">Read the note →</a></div></section>
    </div>
    <div class="now-close"><p>Curious about the work itself?</p><a class="button-link" href="/work">Explore the work →</a></div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
<style>
  .now-page{padding-bottom:4rem}.now-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:2rem;padding:3rem 0}.now-head .lede{margin:0}.now-head .updated{margin:0 0 .4rem}.now-head h1{margin:.8rem 0 1rem}.now-head h1 em{font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-soft)}.updated{font:.75rem var(--mono);color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:2rem}.now-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.now-list section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem;max-width:950px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:3rem 0}.number{font:.75rem var(--mono);color:var(--ink-muted)}.now-list h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)}.now-list p{font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:65ch}.now-close{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;align-items:center;padding:4rem 0}.now-close p{font:400 1.8rem var(--display)}@media(max-width:600px){.now-head{padding:3rem 0 4rem}.now-list section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.5rem;padding:2rem 0}.now-close{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
  .updated,.updated time{color:var(--ink-soft)}
</style>
